# Out of the house into rain: six weather changes (sunny, clear, clouds, smog, fog, overcast, rain), then a look round
# the wet street: rain particles, wet surfaces and reflections, the darker sky (the sky flicker of 2026-10-16).
at 64
tap cross        # Lester's call
at 70
hold ls-up 4.5   # out of the front door
wait 1
seq weather
wait 1
seq weather
wait 1
seq weather
wait 1
seq weather
wait 1
seq weather
wait 1
seq weather
wait 4
hold ls-up 6     # down the drive in the rain
wait 1
hold rs-left 4   # the camera round: the sky, the wet road
wait 1
hold rs-up 1.5
wait 2
hold rs-right 4
wait 1
hold rs-down 2   # down at the road's reflections
wait 15
